===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=pf|impf=chytat}}

# to [[catch]]
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-se}} to [[catch]] hold of, to [[grasp]] ('''[[za]]''' (by) + [[accusative case]])
#: {{uxi|cs|Měl jsem ho [[rovnou]] '''chytit [[za]]''' [[límec]] a ne[[pustit]].|I should have '''grabbed''' him '''by''' the collar right away and not let him go.}}

====Usage notes====
* The preposition '''za''' (behind) is used because you place your hands behinds things when you want to get a grip on them.

